had a wonderful experience during my time in Boston. It had awesome architecture and a really cool history. I followed your advice and went there, it was so peaceful. Good to hear that you've learned a lot of new things at the conference in Detroit!\n[S26T3] (dia_id: D26:3)\n\nDave: Glad you enjoyed Boston! It's got some great architecture and history. Working on this takes me out of my head and calms me down. Here's a pic of my latest car project.\n[Image caption: a photography of a group of people washing a car in a garage]\n[S26T4] (dia_id: D26:4)\n\nCalvin: Dave, that car looks awesome! What got you into engineering cars? I'm totally into cars too and love making new and powerful models.\n[S26T5] (dia_id: D26:5)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! It's always been my thing. My dad took me to my first car show when I was 10, and I was wow-ed! I was hooked and wanted to learn more. Now I'm an automotive engineer and it's crazy to think that something so powerful and cool can be made from small parts.\n[S26T6] (dia_id: D26:6)","text_sha256":"2ddd8e2078be7fa0a3477917eb8b1d9402e47c0acc9cf8a363bee09e0bba3bd8","timestamp":"2023-10-25T20:25:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":372,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":13829,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":14201},"model":{"requested_model":"x-test-2","served_models":["deepseek-v4.1-flash"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db685551c3339a6dc","filesystem_tools_sha256":"98017e74a12c2eec4f0139c484d2d6bd809e4f37a8f96c7f419dc9591563dbfa","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3fa6b1160c2f7f9b2a8b3e232721d4ca78a161abb31af0d4f1f2e307b7354581","paper_prompt_id":"ref